            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಳಿಸು (aḷisu) is native Dravidian, from aḻi, \"to be destroyed, disappear\", with -isu, \"to make\": to delete is \"to make disappear\"; DEDR 277 lists the root with Tamil aḻi."
